{
  "text": "QR ADMIN\nBranch\nAll restaurant\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\nUI Audit Second Branch A\nSign out\nBrowse workspace\nQR ORDERING / LAUNCH SETUP\nQR Settings\n\nManage core ordering settings and customer-facing messages.\n\nEnabled\nMobile online payment: Available\n\nPayment collection is active and server credentials are configured. Available methods are determined by your merchant account in Razorpay checkout.\n\nQR ordering\nTurn all QR ordering on or off at once.\nTable ordering\nCodes on tables that identify the table.\nMenu-only codes\nCodes for menu cards; the guest chooses dine-in with a table number, or takeaway.\nCustomer notes\nLet guests add notes to their order.\nCustomisations\nLet guests choose add-ons and options.\nPay at counter\nGuests pay at the counter when they are done.\nOnline payment\nRazorpay mobile checkout. Available to guests once payment collection is active.\nShow order status\nGuests can follow Received, Preparing, Ready.\nSend straight to the kitchen\nWhen off, the counter accepts each order first.\nAsk for name\nGuests must enter their name.\nAsk for mobile number\nGuests must enter their mobile number.\nGuest page: words, colour and logo\n\nEdit your heading, messages, colour and logo with a live preview of exactly what guests will see, on Customer Branding.\n\nOpen Customer Branding →",
